  unitName: Voodoo Child (EU)
  unitId: 730153
  unitNumber: 7091
  description: Voodoo Child is convinced that music literally saved his life during
    the apocalypse. He hid in a subwoofer whose vibrations, which were perfectly
    tuned to the ground shaking, destroyed the debris that should have crushed him
    and instantly killed a mutant who wanted him dead. Once he emerged, he dedicated
    his life to building instruments that reproduce the phenomenon.
  summonDesc: Some music?
  fusionDesc: Guitar riffs to calm them down.
